Sometime back was pawing at [async forEach in JavaScript](http://h3manth.com/content/async-foreach-javascript) that helped me to make a simple inject function that would help in loading CSS and JavaScript files to the HTML asynchronously!

__Here is the code to load CSS and JavaScript Asynchronously :__

```javascript
function asyncInject(array, fn, delay){
  var i = 0;
  window.setTimeout(function iter(){
    if(i===array.length){
      return;
    }
    fn.call(array, array[i], i++);
    window.setTimeout(iter, delay);
  }, 0);
}
```

