A dramatic dialogue about async evolution in JavaScript:

## The Callback Era

```javascript
function read(filename, callback) {
  fs.readFile(filename, 'utf8', function(err, res) {
    if (err) return callback(err);
    callback(null, res);
  });
}
```

**Avoiding Callback Hell:**
- Name your functions
- Keep code shallow
- Modularize
- Bind `this`

## The Promise Era

```javascript
promise.then(result => {
  console.log(result);
}).catch(err => {
  console.log(err);
});

## The Async/Await Era
javascript
async function getData() {
  const result = await fetch(url);
  return result.json();
}
```

